1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,400
Imagine seeing the full opportunity ecosystem surrounding your organization —

2
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:08,433
in one clear view.

3
00:00:09,767 --> 00:00:15,400
It starts with what makes you, you. Your mission. Your location. The people you serve.

4
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,633
Your goals. Your current capacity.

5
00:00:18,967 --> 00:00:25,067
Anansi Atlas builds your profile around those answers. Not a template. Never the same twice.

6
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:31,600
Change the mission, and the web changes with it. Change the geography, and new pathways appear.

7
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:37,733
A youth program serving one county. A housing nonprofit working statewide.

8
00:00:37,733 --> 00:00:42,067
An arts organization in three cities. Each one sees a different web —

9
00:00:42,067 --> 00:00:43,967
because each one is different.

10
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:51,967
What you receive is a working map. Funders. Partners. Public programs. Resources. Readiness.

11
00:00:51,967 --> 00:00:54,467
And a thirty-day plan to act on it.

12
00:00:56,133 --> 00:00:59,233
Your mission. Your location. Your opportunity web.
